

-> Steps of Object Creation
    Class loaded
    Memory allocated in heap
    Default values assigned
    Constructor called
    Object reference returned

-> Where Are Objects Created?
   👉 Heap Memory


-> When is Constructor Called?
👉 After memory allocation, before reference returned

class Test {
    Test() {
        System.out.println("Constructor called");
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Test t = new Test();
    }
}
